\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Vs. Dlr Due To Ample Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 1996\par 05:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Monday as ample rupiah liquidity has put selling pressure on the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers note that Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , early Monday injected 1.184 trillion rupiah into the money market system. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is being bought at 2,327.25 rupiah in the spot market at 0309 GMT Monday, after starting the day at 2,326.60 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  ``The market is pretty quiet Monday but ample liquidity is helping the dollar,'' stated one trader at a foreign bank. Traders see the dollar trading in a range between 2,326 rupiah and 2,328 rupiah through the end of Monday. \par \par \uc2  And this tight trading range is expected to continue through the end of the week. The rupiah's high yield is still causing lots of foreign interest, dealer note, but the fact that the dollar is trading at the lower-end of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band limits the depths to which the dollar can fall. \par \par \uc2  Because of this, traders see the dollar trading in a range of 2,326 rupiah to 2,330 rupiah through the end of the week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-06-96 \par \par \uc2  0340GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds7105dgx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
