\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Flat Vs. U.S. Dollar In Early Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 1996\par 06:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is mainly flat versus the U.S. dollar in trading early Wednesday as end-of-the-month and end-of-the-quarter obligations are keeping the rupiah attractive, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Traders say, however, that the dollar won't fall much further Wednesday as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is pushing near the bottom end of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,329 rupiah in the spot market at 0340 GMT Wednesday after starting the day at 2,329.12 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Liquidity is stable today, but the market is looking ahead to the end of the month and the end of the quarter when they'll need rupiah to meet obligations,' said Aulia Mochtar, a dealer at Mitsubishi Bank Buana in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia, Indonesia' \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , early Wednesday left unchanged its dollar-rupiah exchange rate indication, or the early fixing, at 2,318 rupiah-2,436 rupiah and its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,318 rupiah-2,436 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Because the dollar is falling ever closer to the 2,318 rupiah level, traders expect the dollar to find support at 2,328 rupiah. Upside resistance is seen at 2,330 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Market players don't see the dollar making much headway against the rupiah through the end of the week. Rather, it will be stuck in the same dynamic as on Wednesday, with trading held between 2,328 rupiah and 2,330 rupiah through the end of the week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 2