\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah strengthens after band widening. \b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juni 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, June 13 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah rose sharply against the dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  broadened its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to five percent from three percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupiah touched a high of 2,320.0 from 2,336.0 before the dollar managed to rebound to 2,327.5/28.0 late in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  They said the dollar dropped sharply and found some support at around 2,325.0 level. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said the move had surprised the market although it had been widely anticipated. \par \par \uc2  "There was no quote immediately after the widening. The dollar suddenly tumbled to 2,330 and fell all the way down to a low 2,320.0," one European bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "Operators keep saying 'yours' all the time whatever price you quoted. It'a a bit drastic," he added. \par \par \uc2  However, he said the dollar rebounded graduallly and could stabilise at around the 2,327/28.0 level. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said it was not clear where the rate would head on Friday, but the liquidity condition could become the factor to look at in the short-term. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers speculated on an ample supply of liquidity on Friday following dollar buying by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched its base rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated to have bought some $300 to $700 million from the market. \par \par \uc2  "I must say it was good timing," the European bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He said swap rates were stable after the widening of the band. \par \par \uc2  "Swaps were stable. Some corporate clients seemed to cover short outright positions as spot dollars fell," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market had cooled down for now. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened the dollar-rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to 118 rupiah, or five percent, from 66 rupiah or three percent. \par \par \uc2  The new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band on Thursday was 2,315/2,433 rupiah to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The conversion band remained unchanged. It was fixed at 2,315.0/2,361.0 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if the exchange rate goes outside the perimeters. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 16.00/16.50, two at 31.5/33.5, three at 48.0/49.5 and six at 96.50/98.00. \par \par \uc2  The fall of the dollar after the broadening of the band was in line with market expectations because the market was bullish on the rupiah before the long-anticipated move was realised. \par \par \uc2  -- Mantik Kusjanto +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds6d06n50\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
