\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Data/Amplifer -3: Tight Policy Needed \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 1996\par 14:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  But the majority opinion is that foreign capital will continue to flow in at a rapid rate, and so Indonesia will need to maintain a tight monetary policy. One economist even suggests that the recent strong trade figures could make it more difficult for Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, to control money supply. \par \par \uc2  Daragh Maher, an economist at ING Baring Securities Hong Kong Ltd., argues that the improved data will reduce the risk premium for Indonesia and encourage more capital inflows. This process 'will make Bank Indonesia's job of cooling down the economy all the more difficult,' he says. \par \par \uc2  'These positive figures could be self defeating with all of this foreign money coming in,' Maher adds. \par \par \uc2  He noted that in April, Indonesia's M2 money supply growth was up 30% from a year earlier. \par \par \uc2  Maher said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have to continue using moral suasion to clamp down on credit growth and also suggested that a widening of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band could be in store, a move that would create greater uncertainty about \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk. \par \par \uc2  Currently the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band has a spread of 66 rupiah, but Maher suggests it could be widened to 88 rupiah. 'This would increase the cost of hedging for any speculative players,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Many foreign investors put money in Indonesia to benefit from the country's relatively high interest rates. Such plays are threatened by big moves in the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  But Maher also noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's task could be easier if the U.S. Federal Reserve hikes interest rates later in the year. That would make short-term investments less attractive by reducing the spread of Indonesian interest rates over equivalent dollar rates.< \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-06-96 \par \par \uc2  1227GMT \par \par \uc2  1139 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds6504ltb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
