\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  to take action on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  band. \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, May 30 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , might take action to widen its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band for dollar-rupiah trading, economists said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  One senior economist said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might take some action to widen the band for dollar-rupiah trading again after it had broadened it to three percent, or 66 points (rupiah to the dollar) last December. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band allows the bank to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when market rates move out of the band that the bank fixes on a daily basis. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar had been hovering at the floor rate of the band for some time and economists said this might lead to the bank broadening the band. \par \par \uc2  But they said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might also undermine its monetary policy to keep money aggregate M2 growth within a certain limit. M2 growth has already risen over the target due to high credit growth in the economy, economists said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band on Wednesday was at 2,331.0/2,397 and the conversion rate at 2,331.0/2,375.0. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limit