\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia:Rupiah Dn Vs Dlr: Resistance At 2,332 Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1996\par 05:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah weakened slightly versus the U.S. dollar in quiet trading early Tuesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, raised the trading band by one rupiah late Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  However, expectation of tight rupiah liquidity at month end maintains the rupiah's virtual strength. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit was trading at 2,331.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0257 GMT Tuesday, up from its opening level at 2,330.75 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Higher dollar's trading level was just because of the rupiah's depreciation factor,' said Trisiladi Supriyanto, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at PT Indosuez \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bank. \par \par \uc2  Late Monday Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band by one rupiah and became 2,330 rupiah - 2,396 rupiah. Banks can sell the dollar to Bank Indonesia if it touches 2,330 rupiah. It usually happens if banks desperately need the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Yayang Wijaya at PT Bank Mitsubishi Buana, however, sees no urgency for banks at the moment to sell the dollar to Bank Indonesia as in fact rupiah supply early Tuesday was still sufficient. \par \par \uc2  Because of those two reasons, the dollar is seen trapped Tuesday between support level of 2,330.50 rupiah and resistance level of 2,332 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may ascend to a higher level of 2,333 rupiah in the next three days if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  again increases \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-05-96 \par \par \uc2  0310GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5s04eqh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
