\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia 's Rupiah Down Vs Dlr; Thin Holiday Market \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1996\par 06:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah is down versus the U.S. dollar in an extremely thin market early Thursday as players look to cover short-dollar positions from last week, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,306.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0420 GMT Thursday, after starting the day at 2,306.10 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Jakarta's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has been closed since Feb. 16 for the Muslim New Year of Lebaren. The dollar closed on Friday at 2302.00 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'It could be a volatile market today as the market is still very thin,' said Aulia Mochtar, a trader at Mitsubishi Bank Buana.  'Most market players remain on vacation for Lebaran.' \par \par \uc2  Those traders who are in the market, however, including those overseas, seem to be interested in buying dollars. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar was oversold last week as many traders sold dollars for rupiah after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the lower end of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band,' said Trisiladi Supriyanto, a trader at Indosuez \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Supriyanto added that overseas funds, which have been buying into the rupiah due to its high yield, have been selling rupiah for dollars. \par \par \uc2  Traders see the dollar trading in a range Thursday of between 2,306.00 rupiah and 2,310.00 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Traders note that although there is a great deal of room on the topside for the dollar, support is solid at the 2,310.00-rupiah level. \par \par \uc2  A trader at a foreign bank noted that a large Indonesian bank began selling rupiah early Thursday morning only to find such strong support for the rupiah that they are now bidding on it. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0517GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01lfz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
