\par\par \b \uc2  Rupiah edges down on ample Jakarta money market. \b0\par\par\uc2 346 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Feb 16 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah edged down against the dollar in moderate early trading following excess rupiah supply, dealers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  They said operators were well prepared to face the last trading days before heading for a long weekend and the first day of the new reserve requirement rate. \par \par \uc2  "The market was flooded with rupiah while lacking dollars, causing the value of today dollars to jump," one European bank dealer said, adding that light panic was seen after opening. \par \par \uc2  He said Singapore players were seen buying today dollars up to a high of 2,299.0 before they settled at 2,296.50/97.25. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the excess rupiah supply to the maturing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  securities (SBIs) and at least $500 million of maturing spot dollars sold to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Another foreign bank dealer said overnight swap, due on February 22, fell to a low of 1.6/2.0 points against 3.1/3.7 at the opening. Tom/next swap was at 0.55/0.60. \par \par \uc2  "You can see how liquid is the market now," he said. \par \par \uc2  However, operators shortage of dollars could not utilise the incredibly low swap premiums and were hit by relatively expensive overnight rate in the money market, he said. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last at 2,298.00/98.50, compared with an opening of 2,295.75/96.25. \par \par \uc2  Another foreign bank dealer said the dollar-rupiah rate was likely to range around 2,297.0 and 2,299.0 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 2,294/2,360 and the conversion rate at 2,294/2,338 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 18.50/19.50, two at 38.0/39.0, three at 58.50/58.25 and six at 117.0/119.5. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed for Eid al-Fitr celebrations from February 19-21 and reopen on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -- Mantik Kusjanto, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds2g01brt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
