\par\par \b \uc2  Rupiah adjusts on holidays, trading slow. \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Februar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Feb 15 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah adjusted lower against the dollar in slow early trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One foreign bank dealer said spot rupiah opened at 2,296.25/96.75 but was bought up to 2,296.0/96.4 later, reflecting sustained bullish sentiment in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah should be adjusted to the 2,297.0 level. But strong support keeps the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  adjusted lower," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market activity was relatively slow on Thursday because operators appeared to be well prepared to face the last two trading days before heading for long weekend. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were last at 2,292.65/93.35 and 2,292.0/92.5, respectively. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.55/0.65 and tom/next at 3.3/3.5. \par \par \uc2  Operators seemed to be mixed over the rupiah's trading level when the market reopens next Thursday, with some looking for a lower rupiah based on past experience while others expected a stronger rupiah on declining tom/next rate. \par \par \uc2  One said offshore players tended to push the rupiah lower in the past when the local market closed for long holidays. \par \par \uc2  "I don't know whether this may happen again because Eid al-Fitr happens to be at the same time as the Lunar new year." \par \par \uc2  But he expected the dollar-rupiah rate to range around 2,296.0 and 2,297.0 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said liquidity on Friday may not be that tight as feared previously because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated to have absorbed at least $500 million from the market on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to 2,294/2,360 and the conversion rate to 2,294/2,338 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 17.75/18.50, two at 37.5/38.5, three at 57.5/58.5 and six at 117.0/119.0. \par \par \uc2  -- Mantik Kusjanto, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds2f01i6s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
