\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Down Slightly Vs. Dlr; Tight Range \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 1996\par 05:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah fell slightly versus the U.S. dollar in tight trading early Wednesday, but little support is seen for the dollar as the rupiah is in strong demand ahead of the Muslim New Year of Lebaren, dealers report. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is currently being bought at 2,293.25 rupiah in the spot market at 0318 GMT Wednesday, after starting the day at 2,293.00 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The dollar could find some support later in the day, however, if Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , decides to increase the lower end of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to 2,294.00 rupiah from its current level of 2,293.00 rupiah, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Rumors floating in the market report that Bank Indonesia will make this change at 0800 GMT Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Because of these opposing forces affecting the rupiah, traders see the dollar trading in an extremely tight range of between 2,293.00 rupiah and 2,293.50 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The market is divided into two camps, those thinking Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level and those who don't,' said Trisiladi Supriyanto, a dealer at Indosuez Indonesia. 'This will keep trading very narrow.' \par \par \uc2  Profit-taking, however, is seen possible during the later stages of the week, as players don't want to get stuck in long rupiah positions with the long weekend approaching, said Pardy Kardy a dealer at Mitsubishi Bank Buana. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed from Feb. 19 to Feb. 21 next week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0423GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2e01b3y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
