\par\par \b \uc2  Rupiah stable,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  keeps fixing unchanged. \b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Feb 9 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah was stable against the dollar in late trading, dealers said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  They said market players were making few moves after Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged at 2,292/2,358 and the conversion rate also at 2,292/2,336. \par \par \uc2  One foreign dealer said a weaker dollar in late Tokyo trade may have stopped the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  from raising the fixing. \par \par \uc2  "The market was a bit mixed over the fixing policy, causing some spot covering in the morning. But the market now seems to be rather dull," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said rupiah's sentiment remained firm. \par \par \uc2  They said caution on liquidity supply in the coming week, the last week before the starting of Eid al-Fitr and Lunar New Year festivities as well as the new reserve requirement rate, continued to be an underlying concern for operators. \par \par \uc2  One said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have to absorb dollars early next week but the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to adjust on Thursday and Friday due to market and public holidays. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed from February 19 to 21 and the stock market shut from February 19 to 23. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was last at 2,292.80/93.00 against the opening of 2,292.75/93.50. Tomorrow was at 2,290.50/92.80. \par \par \uc2  Today rupiah closed at 2,290.80/91.10. \par \par \uc2  Tom/next swap was at 0.50/0.55 points. \par \par \uc2  One said the dollar-rupiah rate is likely to hover in a range of 2,292.0 and 2,294.0 on Monday, with some additional rupiah supply as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed to have drained some dollars from the market on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 17.5/18.5, two at 38.0/39.5, three at 58.00/59.75 and six at 118.5/120.0. \par \par \uc2  -- Mantik Kusjanto, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds2901n1n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
