\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Down Vs Dlr On Profit-Taking \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1996\par 04:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah saw a minor correction downwards against the U.S. dollar Monday on profit-taking, dealers said. The market, however, has been trading at a very sluggish pace. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit was trading at 2,291.25 rupiah in the spot market at 0321 GMT Monday, off its intraday high of 2,291.62 rupiah. The dollar opened at 2,290.50 rupiah Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers bought back the dollar as it is just slightly above the floor of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band early Monday at 2,290 rupiah - 2,356 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  However, the differential between the rupiah's and the dollar's interest rate has kept demand for the rupiah strong, dealers said. They add that the interest rates differential stands at approximately 10 percentage points. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar has very limited room to move down,' said a dealer with a foreign bank. 'And there is still nothing new to speculate on.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers see the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trapped in a tight range Monday of between 2,291 rupiah and 2,292 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Further short-covering is expected to boost the dollar to a higher resistance level in the next three days to 2,293 rupiah. Dealers see 2,291 rupiah as the solid support level for the dollar through Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0342GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds25011fw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppic