\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Dn Vs Dlr; Dlr Topmost Seen At 2,285 Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 338 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 1995\par 06:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-DJ)--Indonesia's rupiah weakened versus the U.S. dollar in volatile dealings early Thursday in Jakarta dealings, prompted by dollar's surge against the rupiah in New York dealings Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is being purchased at 2,279 rupiah at 0324 GMT on the spot market, down from its intra-day high of 2,282.50 rupiah, but above Wednesday close at 2,274 rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar's surge in New York dealings Wednesday, which hit its high at around 2,307 rupiah, was ignited by speculation that Bank Indonesia will announce an important policy move on exchange rates during a press conference scheduled at 0900 GMT Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The speculation is that Bank Indonesia will remove its dollar-rupiah trading band, and let the rupiah float freely. The reason for letting the rupiah freely float is to quicken rupiah's depreciation in a bid to increase Indonesia's exports which are seen dwindling. \par \par \uc2  But an official with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has denied that the press conference will be on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  Dealers see the dollar well supported at 2,275 rupiah Thursday partly on overnight buying order from dealers in New York, and persistent strong rupiah liqudity. Resistance for the dollar is seen at 2,285 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the dollar breaks the ceiling of the trading band,' a dealer with a local bank said. Dealers added that Bank Indonesia has checked rates early Thursday, which is usually seen by the market as an indication of an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'However, I don't think Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday as the dollar's surge against the rupiah eased down after news that Bank Indonesia denied speculation that an important policy on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be announced in the press conference,' Yayang Wijaya, a dealer with PT Bank Mitsubishi Buana said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-08-95 \par \par \uc2  0410GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8o06gne\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
