\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia/US Dlr/Trading Band -2: BI Has Bought Dlrs In Past \b0\par\par\uc2 188 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 1995\par 03:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-DJ)--The U.S. Dollar fell through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band floor of 2,224 rupiah on the spot market early Friday, dealers in Singapore said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar has been sold on the spot market at 2,223.75 rupiah, the dealers said. Late Thursday Bank Indonesia set the trading band at 2,224 rupiah to sell the dollar and 2,254 rupiah to buy the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dollar-rupiah movement outside of the 30-rupiah wide trading band set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , usually prompts \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to nudge the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  back within the band. \par \par \uc2  In December Bank Indonesia bought a large amount of dollars to support the flagging U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and to aid the steady depreciation of the rupiah, a government policy. \par \par \uc2  At 0053 GMT Friday the dollar has gained slightly to 2,224 rupiah and is on the edge of the trading band, dealers said. Dealing in Jakarta has not yet opened. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-06-95 \par \par \uc2  0107GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr6904aue\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
