\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -2: Spent 500M Dlrs  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 193 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 1995\par 12:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-DJ)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor J. Soedradjad Djiwandono said Friday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called the effect on Indonesia from Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis a 'mini-crisis' that so far they have been able to manage. \par \par \uc2  In a meeting with foreign journalists, Soedradjad said the possibility is 'still there' for another rush on dollars, which occurred in Indonesia about a week ago in the wake of nervous foreign funds flowing out of the emerging market. \par \par \uc2  The governor vowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be vigilant in supporting the rupiah from a sharp depreciation, and confirmed that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent 500 million dlrs last week \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot and forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to support the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  In the wake of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  instability that swept through Asia, Bank Indonesia is also 'discussing and looking into the aftermath of what happened,' with neighboring central banks in the region, possibly to 'coordinate on what we can do in the future,' Soedradjad said. \par \par \uc2  'We are similar as emerging markets and liable to this kind of movement,' Soedradjad said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-01-95 \par \par \uc2  1157GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1k008eu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\pic