\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia raises key rate to defend rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mantik Kusjanto \par \uc2 583 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 16 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in fresh action following major market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week, hiked key discount rates on Monday to boost the rupiah after earlier fears of a possible Mexican-style devaluation. \par \par \uc2  "We have raised the interest rates of SBPUs for all maturities by half a percentage point," an official told Reuters. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers, who said the move would help support the rupiah, said it was also aimed at stopping players from taking advantage of interest rate differentials. \par \par \uc2  "The move was aimed at preventing banks from taking advantage of the short-term securities (SBPUs) to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one chief dealer with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  One-week money was raised to 15.0 percent from 14.5 percent, two-week money to 15.25 percent from 14.75 percent, and one, three, six and 12-month money to 15.75 from 15.25 percent. \par \par \uc2  Surat Berharga Pasar Uang (SBPUs) are short-term securities bought by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to inject additional liquidity into the banking system. \par \par \uc2  But one money market dealer said the hike was not enough to reduce short-term interest rate differentials between the key discount rates and forward premiums. \par \par \uc2  Value spot dollars were quoted around 2,211.00/12.50 in midday compared with an early high of 2,220 rupiah, but they appeared to be moving in a safe area far below Bank Indonesia's Friday ceiling of 2,188/2,218 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "The move was positive but players can still utilise \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  facilities to buy dollars because of attractive margins on forward premiums," he said. \par \par \uc2  One-month forward premiums were at 11.5 percent, which if added to the revenue from dollar-deposits at 7.25 percent, were comparable to SBPUs of the same maturity at 15.75 percent, he said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the forward market to minimise arbitrage possibilities," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market appeared to have stabilised after Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strong \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market last week totalling $500 million. This followed earlier strong statements that ruled out any possible devaluation. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia Governor Sudradjad Djiwandono said on Saturday foreign fund managers did not understand the fundamental strength of Indonesia's economy. \par \par \uc2  Their concerns over Indonesia's foreign debt of almost $100 billion also triggered a week-long dumping of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But economists and analysts have said any comparisons with Mexico's current financial crisis are unfair and irrational. \par \par \uc2  Dennis de Tray, director of the World Bank in Jakarta, told Reuters on Saturday that with Indonesia's small current account deficit relative to gross domestic product and with non-oil exports expected to top 15 percent growth this year, the country faced no real challenge in its debt management. \par \par \uc2  The foreign bank chief dealer said there was not much buying interest in dollars on Monday but that a higher closing in New York overnight appeared to have left the market nervous. \par \par \uc2  "The market still has not indicated in which direction the dollar is heading. But at the level people in London and the U.S. are buying I do not mind selling to them," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Volume was thin. We did some (dollar) selling this morning and then the dollar market collapsed," he said. \par \par \uc2  Value spot dollars were quoted around 2,211.00/12.50 at midday compared with an early high of 2,220 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr1g070c2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
