\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervention \highlight\uc2  hit $500 mln - agency. \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Jan 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rupiah on Friday reached $500 million, the official Antara news agency reported. \par \par \uc2  "This \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is to show (the public) that in \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  there is no need to worry about devaluation or sharp depreciation," the agency quoted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sudradjad Djiwandono as saying on Saturday. \par \par \uc2  Djiwandono said dollar transactions in Indonesia's banking circles reached around $2 million on Friday. \par \par \uc2  He said such a high demand for dollars should not have happened as Indonesia was different from Mexico, another heavily indebted nation, which devaluated its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by 15 percent on December 20. \par \par \uc2  He said Mexico's devaluation occured because the country's economy was supported by short-term offshore loans. \par \par \uc2  In Indonesia, however, "offshore loans held by the government or private institutions are in the form of long-term loans," he said. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, Djiwandono said, Mexican economic growth was 2.9 percent, against seven percent for Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia has never defaulted on or rescheduled its debt, much of which was private-sector driven during heady offshore borrowing in the late 1980s and early 1990s. \par \par \uc2  The government has said total foreign debt, with less than 50 percent held by private sector, currently stands at around $93 billion. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr1g06xhg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
