\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia/Rupiah/Dlr Overvalued -2: Periodic Rebounds Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 1995\par 05:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  However, the dollar's anticipated slide to 2,208 rupiah will be interrupted by small rebounds because of profit-taking or speculative dollar-buying, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said overseas fund managers, whose confidence in emerging markets has been shaken by the Mexican financial crisis, should notice Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and quash devaluation fears. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said although it is unlikely Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday, tightening rupiah liquidity is seen helping the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the rupiah has been tightened since Friday after the recent rush on dollars, and is expected to be carried over until Monday, although Bank Indonesia added net liquidity of around 202.50 billion rupiah to the money market Monday, \par \par \uc2  The expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's certificates, added 523.50 billion rupiah Monday to the money market, but Surat Berharga Pasar Uang (SBPU), money-market certificates, due Monday, absorbed around 321 billion rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia left the dollar-rupiah indication exchange rate, or early fixing, unchanged Monday at 2,188 rupiah to sell the dollar and 2,218 rupiah to buy the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah interbank rate is still locked at around 14% by rupiah oversupply, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-01-95 \par \par \uc2  0413GMT \par \par \uc2  1