\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Up Vs Dlr; Dlr Seen Overvalued \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 1995\par 04:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-DJ)--The rupiah strengthened against the dollar in active early trading Monday as the dollar is perceived as overvalued from hectic buying last week, which was spurred by overblown fears of rupiah devaluation and was promptly stomped out by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is being bought at 2,214 rupiah on the spot market early Monday, sliding to a low of 2,210.50 rupiah from its opening at 2,220 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is seen supported at 2,216 rupiah, with a resistance at 2,220 rupiah Monday, as speculators are seen less aggressive after \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday to sell an estimated 300 million dlrs to 500 million dlrs to safeguard the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'People have been bearish on the greenback as it has been overbought, and the dollar is downtrending now,' a dealer at a state bank said. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank said, 'We will actively sell the dollar if the dollar rises above the upper band of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-rupiah fixing.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers see that the dollar heading to the 2,208-rupiah level through Wednesday if the dollar breaks through its first level of support at 2,213 rupiah Monday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-01-95 \par \par \uc2  0353GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1g004gs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
